request.description:
Send a message and stream the agent's response via SSE.

Response format (Server-Sent Events):
```
event: token
data: {"type": "token", "content": "Hello", ...}

event: tool_call
data: {"type": "tool_call", "content": "...", ...}

event: interrupt
data: {"type": "interrupt", "content": "...", ...}

event: done
data: {"type": "done", "content": "...", ...}
```

